===Verb===
{{wikidata lexeme|L21}}
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[build]] or [[form]] (something) by [[assemble|assembling]] [[part]]s.
#: {{ux|en|We '''constructed''' the radio from spares.}}
#: {{ux|en|A wall '''constructed''' of random stones.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|grammar}} To build (a [[sentence]], an [[argument]], etc.) by arranging [[word]]s or [[idea]]s.
#: {{ux|en|A sentence may be '''constructed''' with a subject, verb and object.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1997|author=Marita Sturken|title=Tangled Memories
|passage=The Vietnam War films are forms of memory that function to provide collective rememberings, to '''construct''' history, and to subsume within them the experience of the veterans.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|geometry}} To [[draw]] (a [[geometric]] [[figure]]) by following [[precise]] [[specification]]s and using geometric tools and techniques.
#: {{ux|en|'''Construct''' a circle that touches each vertex of the given triangle.}}
#* {{RQ:Bramah Max Carrados|passage=The arc of a circle may be very little, but, given that, it is possible to '''construct''' the entire figure.}}

